// Phase 18 (v18.0.0-embedded & v18.0.0 Standalone):
// Top-in-Class Competitor Supremacy, Live Execution-Trace Guided Synthesis,
// Incremental Whole-Program Merkle-SMT Proof Cache, Predictive AST Tool Prefetcher,
// Visual Live MCP DAG Time-Travel Debugger, Multi-Host PQC Work-Stealing Scheduler,
